            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Section 2: Academic Performance -->
        <div class="section" id="academic">
            <h2>2. Academic Performance Analysis</h2>

            <p>Analysis of the distribution and central tendencies of academic outcomes across Previous GPA, SSC Result, and HSC Result.</p>

